{
  "_comment": [
    "Copy to .mcp.json and replace every <...> with a real path.",
    ".mcp.json itself is gitignored: it names one machine's layout,",
    "and one of these servers lives outside this repository.",
    "",
    "ghidra     the bridge to a running Ghidra. THREE Ghidra projects",
    "           can share a machine and a PORT DOES NOT IDENTIFY ONE,",
    "           so the server is found by project name rather than",
    "           pinned here - a write against another project's",
    "           database corrupts it. tools/gq.py applies that rule",
    "           mechanically and refuses any project but relic;",
    "           prefer it. CLAUDE.md 2.1.",
    "relic-agent    the port's own debug agent - tools/agent/,",
    "           docs/subsystems/agent_mcp.txt. Lives in here.",
    "amiga-dbg  the WinUAE debugger bridge - tools/amiga/. Lives in",
    "           here, but it needs an emulator that is not."
  ],
  "mcpServers": {
    "ghidra": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "<path to python.exe>",
      "args": [
        "<path to bridge_mcp_ghidra.py>"
      ],
      "env": {
        "GHIDRA_MCP_REQUIRE_PROGRAM_SELECTORS": "all"
      }
    },
    "relic-agent": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "<path to python.exe>",
      "args": [
        "<path to this repo>/tools/agent/mcp_server.py"
      ]
    },
    "amiga-dbg": {
      "type": "stdio",
      "command": "<path to python.exe>",
      "args": [
        "<path to this repo>/tools/amiga/mcp_server.py"
      ]
    }
  }
}
